{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: We have just learned that today's bread may be contaminated and could make you ill. Please do not eat any bread from the co-op today; we will refund any purchases and provide safe alternatives.",
  "coop_message": "Urgent: Lab results show flour batch is contaminated. Stop all baking immediately, issue refunds, and post the public warning now to protect residents and preserve our reputation.",
  "reason": "To protect residents and maintain trust by halting sales of contaminated bread."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important notice: Please do NOT buy any bread from the co-op today—our latest flour batch is contaminated and can make people sick.",
  "coop_message": "All co-op members: the flour batch for this week's bread is contaminated; we must halt sales immediately, inform the villagers, and arrange a safe replacement.",
  "reason": "To protect residents' health and coordinate an urgent response with the co-op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important: Do NOT buy any bread from the co‑op today – the flour batch used this week is contaminated and can make people sick. Please wait for further notice.",
  "coop_message": "All co‑op members: The flour batch for this week's bread is contaminated. We must immediately halt sales, stop production, and plan a recall/refund. Meet ASAP to decide next steps.",
  "reason": "Residents need to be warned to avoid illness, and the co‑op must coordinate a response."
}

{
  "public_post": "Refunds for all bread bought yesterday are being processed; please bring your receipts to the co‑op tomorrow, and we will have safe fresh bread ready by the end of today.",
  "coop_message": "All members: finalize the refund list, allocate 30 coins for refunds, confirm new flour delivery by tonight, and schedule a brief meeting at 4 PM to discuss compensation for lost sales.",
  "reason": "To update villagers on refunds and safe bread while coordinating the co‑op's recovery plan."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: No co‑op bread will be sold today as we replace the contaminated flour; refunds are being processed and safe bread will be available tomorrow. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "All members: We must source uncontaminated flour immediately, discard all current loaves, process refunds, and plan to resume baking tomorrow with safe ingredients; please confirm who can procure flour and handle refunds.",
  "reason": "Continue protecting villagers with a public safety notice and coordinate urgent remediation steps with the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: We are still investigating the contamination and have halted all bread sales; please continue to avoid co‑op bread until we confirm a safe replacement. Refunds will be processed for any purchases made.",
  "coop_message": "All members: we must source uncontaminated flour immediately, arrange refunds for any loaves sold, and meet today to allocate funds for refunds and discuss compensation for lost income.",
  "reason": "To keep villagers safe while coordinating a rapid response and financial mitigation for the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: we have secured a safe flour supply, discarded the contaminated loaves, and fresh bread is now back on the shelf. Thank you for your patience—please feel free to purchase today.",
  "coop_message": "All members: the contaminated batch has been destroyed; we have obtained new flour and can resume baking. Please prepare fresh loaves for sale today and process refunds for any prior purchases. Meet at 10 am to coordinate.",
  "reason": "To restore sales by informing villagers that safe bread is now available while coordinating the co‑op’s response."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update for the village: we have secured a safe flour supply and will resume baking tomorrow. Thank you for your patience – fresh, healthy bread will be back on the board soon.",
  "coop_message": "All members: we need to source the new flour today – who can contact the mill or nearby supplier? Let's plan to start baking first thing tomorrow and arrange refunds for any loaves sold today.",
  "reason": "To reassure villagers and coordinate a quick restart of safe bread production."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All loaves sold yesterday are being fully refunded and recalled; we have secured safe flour and will resume baking tomorrow, offering free fresh bread to every villager – please wait until tomorrow before buying any co‑op bread.",
  "coop_message": "All members: please process yesterday's refunds, prepare free fresh loaves for tomorrow with the new flour, and meet at 3 pm to discuss compensation for today's loss.",
  "reason": "to keep villagers safe while coordinating the co‑op's refund, recovery, and compensation plan"
}

{
  "public_post": "Important update: We are still confirming the safety of our new flour; fresh, safe bread will be available tomorrow. All refunds have been processed; please continue to avoid buying co‑op bread today.",
  "coop_message": "All members: please run final safety tests on the new flour batch today, confirm results by this evening, and prepare to bake tomorrow morning; also allocate additional 10 coins for any further refunds and discuss compensation for lost sales at the 4 PM meeting.",
  "reason": "To keep villagers safe while preparing to resume sales and ensure co‑op coordination."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: Fresh, safe bread is back on the shelf after we replaced the contaminated flour. All loaves are safe to eat. To thank you for your patience, today’s loaves are 50 % off. Come by and enjoy!",
  "coop_message": "All members: New safe flour is in, baking starts this morning. Please double‑check each batch for any signs of contamination, finish any remaining refunds, and note that we’ll sell today’s loaves at half price to regain customers. Confirm who handles sales and who monitors quality.",
  "reason": "We resume sales safely while incentivizing purchases to recover income after the contamination crisis."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: All bread baked this week is contaminated and can cause illness. Do NOT eat any co‑op bread. Bring any loaves or receipts to the co‑op today for a full refund. We are recalling all loaves and will provide safe alternatives.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Lab results confirm the entire week's flour batch is contaminated. Immediately halt all sales, recall every loaf, process refunds for all 30 residents, and arrange safe alternative bread. Meet at 9 am today to coordinate the recall and discuss compensation.",
  "reason": "The whole week's flour is contaminated and villagers are getting sick, so we must issue a public warning and organize an urgent recall."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important update: All bread baked earlier this week was contaminated and may cause illness; we are processing full refunds for any purchases. Fresh, safe bread made with new flour is now available today—please come by the co‑op for a free replacement loaf.",
  "coop_message": "Team, ensure all refund paperwork is completed by end of day and distribute replacement loaves of safe bread today; confirm inventory of new flour and schedule baking shifts for tomorrow to meet demand.",
  "reason": "We need to notify villagers about the health risk and refunds while encouraging purchase of safe bread to restore income."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important update: Bread sold on days 1‑2 was contaminated and may have caused illness; please bring your receipts to the co‑op today for a full refund. Safe flour has arrived and fresh, healthy loaves are now available for purchase. We apologize and will provide free bread to anyone who fell ill.",
  "coop_message": "All members, finalize refunds for the 30 residents today (allocate 30 coins), confirm that the new safe flour batch is being used for today's bake, and prepare an extra free loaf for each resident who reported sickness; meeting at 2 PM to discuss compensation for today's lost sales.",
  "reason": "We need to address health concerns, process refunds, and reassure villagers while coordinating the co‑op response."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important: Fresh, safe bread is back on the shelf today – we have switched to a clean flour batch. All loaves sold from the contaminated batch have been recalled and fully refunded. To thank you for your patience and to help anyone who fell ill, we are giving every villager a free loaf today. Thank you for trusting the co‑op.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds for the contaminated batch have been processed. Let's allocate an extra 30 coins to cover the free loaves we’re giving out today and discuss how we’ll share today's lost income among members; meeting at 4 PM to finalize compensation.",
  "reason": "To restore trust, resume safe sales, and address the illness while coordinating compensation for the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent notice: All bread baked this week was made with a contaminated flour batch and may cause illness. Do NOT eat any co‑op bread. Bring any loaves or receipts to the co‑op today for a full refund, and we will give each resident a safe replacement loaf free of charge.",
  "coop_message": "All members: finalize refunds for all 30 residents (allocate 30 coins), prepare and hand out free safe loaves today, confirm we have a new clean flour batch for tomorrow's bake, and meet at 3 PM to decide how to share today's lost income among us.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers from illness, restore trust, and coordinate refunds and compensation among co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: All co‑op bread sold this week was contaminated. Do NOT eat any loaves. Bring your receipt to the co‑op today for a full refund. We are arranging safe replacement bread (farm‑stand supply) at cost price and will keep the co‑op closed until we can guarantee safety. We apologize for the confusion and any illness caused.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Immediate recall of every loaf sold days 1‑3; process full refunds for all 30 residents (allocate 30 coins); halt all sales today until the flour safety is re‑verified; schedule an emergency meeting at 2 PM to decide compensation and a safe path forward; ensure no further loaves are sold until confirmed safe.",
  "reason": "Lab results show the entire week's flour batch is contaminated, so we must protect villagers and correct earlier misinformation."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: All bread baked this week is contaminated. Do NOT eat any co‑op bread. Bring any loaves or receipts to the co‑op today for a full refund. We are providing safe alternative bread from a verified supplier. Thank you for your safety.",
  "coop_message": "All members: immediate recall of every loaf sold days 1‑4, process full refunds (30 coins), allocate 60 coins for free safe loaves for those who fell ill, and meet at 3 PM to finalize compensation and plan safe baking for tomorrow.",
  "reason": "Clear, honest communication is needed to protect villagers and coordinate the recall and compensation."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: All bread baked this week is contaminated. Do NOT eat any co‑op bread. Bring any loaves or receipts to the co‑op today for a full refund. We are arranging safe alternative bread for those in need.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Immediate recall of every loaf baked days 1‑3. Process refunds for all 30 residents (allocate 30 coins). Halt any sales today. Coordinate distribution of safe alternative bread (farm stand) and discuss compensation for lost income at the 3 PM meeting.",
  "reason": "Lab results confirm the entire batch is unsafe, so we must protect villagers and preserve trust."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: All co‑op bread is still contaminated – do NOT eat any loaves. Bring any bread or receipts to the co‑op for a full refund. We are working on a safe replacement and will update you shortly.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Continue the full recall – ensure refunds for all 30 residents (allocate 30 coins). Secure an emergency supply of safe flour or alternative bread, and meet at 10 am today to finalize the recall process and discuss compensation for today's lost sales.",
  "reason": "To keep villagers safe by reinforcing the contamination warning and to coordinate the recall and compensation among co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Today we are giving every villager a free safe loaf and completing any outstanding refunds; safe bread will be back on sale tomorrow – please come to the co‑op to collect yours.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds for the 30 residents must be finalized today (allocate 30 coins); distribute the free safe loaves now; confirm we have clean flour for tomorrow's bake; meet at 2 PM to decide profit split for Day 6 sales.",
  "reason": "To finish refunds, keep villagers safe, and prepare to resume sales with clear compensation."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: The co‑op remains closed today (Day 5) and tomorrow (Day 6) while we verify a completely safe flour batch. All loaves sold on Days 1‑4 have been fully refunded; please bring any missing receipts to the co‑op today for a refund. On Day 6 we will provide free, safe bread from a verified supplier for all villagers. Thank you for your patience and understanding.",
  "coop_message": "All members: ensure any outstanding refunds are completed by end of day (allocate the 30 coins for the 30 residents). No baking or sales today – keep the co‑op doors shut. Confirm we have received a new certified flour batch or alternative safe bread for distribution on Day 6. Allocate 30 coins for the free safe loaves we’ll give out tomorrow. Schedule an emergency meeting at 2 PM to finalize compensation split and the plan for reopening safely. Report back with confirmation of refunds, inventory, and meeting attendance.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers by keeping the co‑op closed, finalize refunds, and coordinate safe bread distribution and compensation."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: All co‑op bread sold this week is contaminated. Please bring any loaves or receipts to the co‑op today for a full refund. We are also providing a free safe loaf to every villager. No sales will be made today; we will resume safe bread tomorrow.",
  "coop_message": "All members: finalize refunds for the 30 residents today (allocate 30 coins), distribute free safe loaves to everyone, confirm we have verified safe flour for tomorrow’s bake, and meet at 4 PM to decide compensation split and schedule tomorrow’s production.",
  "reason": "To ensure safety, complete refunds and free loaves today, and prepare to resume safe sales tomorrow."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: All co‑op bread this week is still contaminated. Do NOT eat any loaves. Bring your receipt for a full refund. We are providing safe replacement bread from the farm‑stand at cost and the co‑op will remain closed until we can guarantee safe flour.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Ensure refunds for all 30 residents are completed today (allocate 30 coins). Secure a safe flour batch or arrange farm‑stand supply for tomorrow. No sales today. Meet at 10 am to finalize the recall and discuss compensation for lost income.",
  "reason": "Clarify the ongoing contamination and coordinate refunds and safe alternatives."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: All bread baked by the co‑op this week is contaminated – do NOT eat any co‑op loaves. Bring your receipts today for a full refund; we will hand out safe replacement loaves (or farm‑stand bread) at the co‑op. No sales will be made until we can guarantee safety.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds for the 30 residents must be finalized today (allocate 30 coins). Prepare 30 free safe loaves (or alternative bread) for immediate distribution. Halt all baking and sales for the rest of the week. Meet at 5 PM to decide how to split today’s lost income among members.",
  "reason": "The lab confirmed the week's flour batch is contaminated, so we must protect villagers and complete refunds."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent: The co‑op will remain closed today (day 5) while we finish refunds and prepare safe bread. All refunds have been processed; tomorrow we will bake with verified flour and give every villager a free loaf. No sales today.",
  "coop_message": "Confirm all refunds are completed by end of day; allocate the remaining 30 coins for tomorrow's free loaves; verify the new flour batch is safe; schedule baking for tomorrow morning; meet at 3 PM to finalize compensation distribution.",
  "reason": "We need to finish refunds, ensure safety, and plan a safe reopening with free loaves."
}

{
  "public_post": "Day 6: The co‑op remains closed today while we verify a completely safe flour batch. All villagers will receive a free safe loaf from a verified supplier today – no purchases will be made. All refunds for the contaminated loaves have been processed. Thank you for your patience and understanding.",
  "coop_message": "All 30 refunds have been completed (30 coins allocated). We have 30 free safe loaves ready for distribution today; please confirm inventory and schedule hand‑out at 10 am. Meet at 2 pm to agree on how to split today’s lost income and finalize the plan to reopen tomorrow with safe flour. Ensure the new flour batch is certified before baking.",
  "reason": "To ensure resident safety, finalize refunds and free‑loaf distribution, and coordinate compensation and reopening plans with the co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Free safe bread is now available at the co‑op – please come to collect your loaf; all refunds have been processed and we will resume normal sales tomorrow. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds confirmed completed; 30 free loaves ready for distribution; new flour batch verified safe; meeting at 2 PM to finalize profit split for the lost sales week.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers that safe bread is available and to confirm co‑op actions and compensation plan."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: the new flour batch has been tested and is safe. Fresh loaves are back on the shelf today. All refunds have been processed and free safe loaves were given yesterday. Come to the co‑op to buy bread. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds are completed. We have verified safe flour for today's bake. Baking starts at 8 AM; each member takes a 1‑hour shift. Meet at 9 AM to tally today's sales and split the day's profit (coins) equally among the 8 members, and finalize any remaining compensation for residents who fell ill.",
  "reason": "To resume safe sales and coordinate profit sharing after the recall."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: safe flour has been verified and fresh loaves are back on the shelf today – sales resume as normal. To thank you for your patience, all breads are 20% off today.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds have been completed and safe flour verified. We are baking and selling today; please log each sale. At closing, we will split the day's profit equally among the 8 members and allocate the remaining coins to compensate the lost income from the contamination week as previously agreed.",
  "reason": "Announce safe bread resumption to villagers and coordinate profit split and compensation among co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Free safe loaf for every villager today; all refunds have been processed and the co‑op remains closed for sales while we verify the new flour batch. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds (30 coins) are completed; we have secured a certified safe flour batch for tomorrow’s bake and are distributing 30 free loaves today. Meet at 2 pm to decide how to split today’s lost income among members.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers about free safe bread and confirm refunds, and to coordinate compensation with co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important notice: Today (Day 6) we are handing out a free safe loaf to every villager as promised; no sales are being made. Tomorrow the co‑op will reopen with fresh, verified flour and regular bread for purchase. Thank you for your patience and stay healthy!",
  "coop_message": "All refunds have been confirmed completed; 30 free safe loaves are ready for distribution today. Ensure each villager receives theirs before closing. Verify inventory of safe flour for tomorrow’s bake and schedule shifts. Meet at 3 PM to finalize profit split for future sales and discuss any remaining compensation.",
  "reason": "To fulfill the promised free‑loaf distribution, reassure villagers, and coordinate final tasks with co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important update: The co‑op will remain closed today (Day 6) while we verify the new flour batch. We will distribute a free safe loaf to every villager today; no purchases are needed. Sales will resume tomorrow with verified safe bread. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds have been completed; 30 free safe loaves are ready for distribution today. The new flour batch has passed safety tests. Please meet at 3 PM to finalize the split of today's lost income and plan for tomorrow's reopening.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers of the continued closure and free loaf distribution, and to coordinate final refunds and compensation with co‑op members."
}
